# H7/H11 remediation: uploaded images no longer live in this directory (see
# IMAGES_DIR in config.php — storage moved outside the web document root so
# every request for an image is forced through image.php, which enforces
# rate limiting and expiration on every single request). This folder is kept
# only for backward-compatible deployments; deny it outright so it can never
# again act as a direct, unrated, un-expiring bypass around image.php.
Require all denied
